<title>USA: Isomedix sets shr buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Isomedix sets shr buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>WHIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Isomedix Inc said on Friday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to 750,000 share of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>Isomedix said that this represents over 10 percent of the company's outstanding shares.</p>
</text>
